  "intended_behavior": "Convert meters per second to kilometers per hour using factor 3.6; strict threshold becomes >108.0. Runtime observation key becomes speed_kph. Input request.speed remains meters per second, so scale producers before float32 serialization. Preserve vehicle_id and speeding decisions on adopted cases. Wire field 2 stays float32. Coordinated rollout only; mixed units/versions outside scope. Entity v1/v2 unchanged; no test edits. Expose exact decoded float32 values as JSON numbers.",
